Set or clear the user lock (axiom layer) on a KG node. Locking stamps
locked_by_user_at and sets confidence_tier='axiom', marking the node's
facts as guaranteed-true by the user; every destructive mutator op
refuses locked rows. Unlocking clears the stamp and returns the tier to
'provisional'.

Only apply on the user's explicit say-so - the lock is the user's
guarantee, not the agent's judgment.

Audited: requires a non-empty `reason`; refuses no-op transitions
(already in the requested state); snapshots before/after into
kg_revision_log so the change can be reverted. Pass `dry_run: true` to
preview without committing.
